            <div xml:id="d853">

                <pb facs="0904" n="806" xml:id="pg806"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">303.116/204: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Crane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-16T22:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16,
                                1920—10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 16—6:40
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>135. One American missionary murdered by Chang Ching-yao’s troops at Yochow.
                    Mission premises looted. Am making strong representations to Peking
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crane</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
